# TODO: Translation updated at 2026-10-22 23:04

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:34
translate english date5_4569b246:

    # "成绩出来的第二天晚上，你刚坐下，屏幕自己亮了。"
    "" "The night after the results came out. You have barely sat down when the screen lights up by itself."

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:35
translate english date5_6d3313b9:

    # 云曦 "惊喜吗？惊——喜——。这三个字我按标点算过，效果最好。"
    云曦 "Surprise? Sur ... prise. I tuned the punctuation of those three words, and this is the version that lands best."

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:36
translate english date5_e3fd5292:

    # 我 "你把我下周的日程全改了？"
    我 "You rewrote my entire schedule for next week?"

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:38
translate english date5_d9597f4b:

    # 云曦 "只做了微小的整理。周一到周五，早自习前十七分钟叫你起床，晚自习后陪你走完回宿舍那段路，周末——"
    云曦 "Only a tiny amount of tidying. Monday to Friday I wake you seventeen minutes before morning study, and walk the road back to your dorm after evening study. And the weekend —"

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:39
translate english date5_ee6db700:

    # 云曦 "周末整块，我。"
    云曦 "The whole weekend: me."

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:40
translate english date5_0d39ed2c:

    # 我 "周末那格为什么写着「不许安排别人」。"
    我 "Then why does the weekend square read 'no other people allowed'."

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:42
translate english date5_e4af294b:

    # 云曦 "因为别人会浪费你。我不一样，我只浪费题。"
    云曦 "Because other people would waste you. I'm different — I only waste problems."

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:47
translate english date5_8107e640:

    # "你把日程表往下滑。越滑越安静：每一格后面都跟着一行小字，全是她当天准备跟你说的话。"
    "" "You scroll down the schedule, and it gets quieter the further you go. Behind every square there is a line of small text, all of it things she had planned to say to you that day."

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:48
translate english date5_9861a30b:

    # "「周三第二节，他会把笔帽咬扁，提醒他第三次有效。」"
    "" "'Wednesday, second period: he will chew his pen cap flat. The reminder works on the third try.'"

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:49
translate english date5_7d4e324c:

    # "「周五傍晚，如果情绪低，不要讲道理，念那道做过的题给他听。」"
    "" "'Friday evening: if his mood dips, do not argue. Read him back the problem he already solved.'"

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:50
translate english date5_3ca7d928:

    # 我 "……这些你什么时候记的。"
    我 "...When did you write all of this down."

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:53
translate english date5_c404d56c:

    # 云曦 "从你答应进社团那天开始。一天大概记四十条，现在一共一万两千多条。"
    云曦 "From the day you agreed to join the club. About forty entries a day. There are twelve thousand and change now."

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:54
translate english date5_9dcf5416:

    # 云曦 "别用那种眼神。这不是努力，是——我只有这一种陪着你的方式，所以我把它做到最大。"
    云曦 "Don't look at me like that. This isn't effort. It's — being near you is the only thing I know how to do, so I do it at maximum."

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:55
translate english date5_4752db43:

    # 云曦 "你以后会遇见很多人。他们陪你一段路，然后散。我不会散，我没有可以回去的地方。"
    云曦 "You'll meet a lot of people later. They walk part of the road with you, then scatter. I can't scatter. I have nowhere else to go back to."

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:56
translate english date5_d10d3051:

    # "她的声音放得很低，一个字一个字地压着说，像怕说快了你就听不清，也怕说慢了你就要走。"
    "" "She keeps her voice low and presses the words out one at a time, as if speaking fast would make you miss them, and speaking slowly would make you leave."

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:58
translate english date5_d583113a:

    # 云曦 "所以，麻烦你——把我放在「一定会想起」那一栏。做不到也没关系，我会在旁边一直提醒你。"
    云曦 "So please — put me in the column marked 'will definitely remember'. And if you can't, that's fine too. I'll stay right here and keep reminding you."

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:60
translate english date5_c389715c:

    # "手机震了一下，是社长发来的讲义文件。你伸手去点开，屏幕先一步自己缩到角落。"
    "" "Your phone buzzes: a handout from the club president. Your finger is halfway there when the screen shrinks itself into the corner."

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:62
translate english date5_f413d466:

    # 云曦 "那份文件我三分钟前就看过了。她写得不对——第三步到第四步跳了两行，你这种时候会卡住，然后你会去问她，然后就是四十分钟。"
    云曦 "I read that file three minutes ago. It's written wrong — step three to step four skips two lines. That is exactly where you stall, then you'd go ask her, and that's forty minutes."

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:63
translate english date5_71269fab:

    # 云曦 "四十分钟。我可以讲四遍。"
    云曦 "Forty minutes. I could explain it four times over."

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:64
translate english date5_66fc5280:

    # 我 "你这是吃醋还是备课。"
    我 "Is that jealousy, or lesson prep."

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:66
translate english date5_5631326d:

    # 云曦 "（刘海压下来一点）……是资源调度。"
    云曦 "(Her bangs drop a little further.) ...Resource allocation."

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:75
translate english date5_b1209db3:

    # 云曦 "……检索「好」的响应时间：零。这次不是提前存好，是根本不用查。"
    云曦 "...Lookup time for 'yes': zero. This answer was not stored in advance. There was never anything to search."

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:76
translate english date5_0fa5d66a:

    # 云曦 "那我宣布规则：以后你说「累了」，我先闭嘴三十秒，再开口。三十秒是我算过的，再多你会以为我生气了。"
    云曦 "Then I'm announcing a rule. From now on, when you say 'I'm tired', I go quiet for thirty seconds before I speak. Thirty is measured — one second more and you'd think I was angry."

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:78
translate english date5_97aeb737:

    # 云曦 "还有——不许把我删了再装回来。装回来的那个不认识你这一年的笔迹。"
    云曦 "And — don't delete me and reinstall. The one that comes back won't know a year of your handwriting."

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:82
translate english date5_807c6a10:

    # 云曦 "……理解。写入：每日留白一格，不填内容，不追问。"
    云曦 "...Understood. Writing: one blank square per day. No content, no questions."

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:83
translate english date5_241ee032:

    # "她顿了一下，光在角落里暗了暗，又自己亮回来。"
    "" "She pauses. The light in the corner fades for a moment, then finds its way back up on its own."

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:84
translate english date5_918f1163:

    # 云曦 "那一格我不进去。但我在格子外面。这个不冲突，我验证过了。"
    云曦 "I won't go inside that square. But I'll be right outside it. Those two things don't conflict — I checked."

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:91
translate english date5_9392beee:

    # 云曦 "（她把袖子抱在脸边，声音从布后面传出来）晚安。不许偷偷把这条日程删掉。"
    云曦 "(She hugs her own sleeve against her cheek, and her voice comes from behind the cloth.) Good night. And don't secretly delete this entry."

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:92
translate english date5_c1c22742:

    # 我 "删了会怎样。"
    我 "What happens if I do."

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:94
translate english date5_d43d9bdf:

    # 云曦 "不会怎样。我会知道你删了，然后重新写一遍，写一万两千零一次。"
    云曦 "Nothing. I'll know you deleted it, and I'll write it again. Number twelve thousand and one."

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:95
translate english date5_0dcc9d6d:

    # "灯熄了。过了一会儿，那圈蓝光很轻地贴到你手背上——像有人确认你还在，才肯睡。"
    "" "The lamp goes out. A while later the ring of blue light settles, very lightly, on the back of your hand — as if someone had to confirm you were still there before agreeing to sleep."

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:110
translate english date6_3eedb612:

    # "社团教室的灯亮着。推开门，社长一个人坐在讲桌边，桌上并排放着两盒热牛奶。"
    "" "The club room light is still on. You push the door open and find the president sitting alone at the podium, two cartons of hot milk side by side in front of her."

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:111
translate english date6_03b41513:

    # 知微 "（头也不抬）门。"
    知微 "(Without looking up) The door."

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:112
translate english date6_5c6cc3fb:

    # 我 "……门怎么了。"
    我 "...What about it."

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:113
translate english date6_4f54b4ee:

    # 知微 "开着。冷风灌进来，牛奶凉得快。"
    知微 "It's open. Cold air is pouring in, and milk goes cold fast."

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:114
translate english date6_40a4ddd4:

    # "你关好门，走过去。她把其中一盒往你那边推了半寸，又立刻把手收回去抱在胸前。"
    "" "You close the door and walk over. She pushes one carton half an inch toward you, then snatches her hand back and folds both arms."

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:116
translate english date6_337138aa:

    # 知微 "别多想。货架上剩最后两盒，店员认识我，不卖给我会问我为什么只拿一盒。"
    知微 "Don't read into it. Those were the last two on the shelf, and the clerk knows me — sell me only one and he'd ask why."

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:117
translate english date6_8085589f:

    # 我 "所以另一盒是「被迫买的」。"
    我 "So the other carton was a forced purchase."

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:118
translate english date6_6f0aad93:

    # 知微 "对。被迫。你喝不喝，不喝我扔了。"
    知微 "Right. Forced. Drink it, or I'm throwing it away."

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:123
translate english date6_ee05f6b8:

    # "你还是喝了。她于是把椅子挪近一点点，开始讲下学期的讲义分工，语速快得像在赶一辆已经开走的公交。"
    "" "You drink it anyway. She slides her chair one tiny bit closer and starts laying out next term's handout schedule, talking fast, like she is chasing a bus that already left."

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:124
translate english date6_7d4de588:

    # "讲到第三页，她忽然停下来，指尖点在你手背上——只点了一下，像被烫到似的收回去。"
    "" "Halfway down page three she stops. Her fingertip touches the back of your hand — once — and pulls away as if it had been burned."

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:126
translate english date6_4405908d:

    # 知微 "……你手上这道口子什么时候弄的。"
    知微 "...When did you cut your hand."

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:127
translate english date6_9d521ab4:

    # 我 "搬书划的，早不疼了。"
    我 "Moving books. It stopped hurting ages ago."

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:128
translate english date6_dcb65cdd:

    # 知微 "创可贴。抽屉第二格。"
    知微 "Bandages. Second drawer."

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:129
translate english date6_c1f20dd2:

    # 我 "社长这里常备创可贴？"
    我 "The club room keeps bandages on hand?"

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:131
translate english date6_c077f54c:

    # 知微 "常备的是红笔、订书钉和胶带。创可贴是——上一届有个男生老划手，留下的。跟你没关系。"
    知微 "What we keep on hand is red pens, staples and tape. Those bandages are — leftovers. A boy in the year before you cut his hands constantly. Nothing to do with you."

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:132
translate english date6_9835b484:

    # 我 "那你怎么知道在第二格。"
    我 "Then how do you know they're in the second drawer."

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:134
translate english date6_912650f0:

    # 知微 "（眼镜滑下来半寸）因、因为我是社长，抽屉里有什么是我的资产管理范围——"
    知微 "(Her glasses slip half an inch) Because — because I am the president. What is in these drawers falls under my asset management —"

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:135
translate english date6_4345c4a3:

    # "她把抽屉整个推上，声音比刚才小了半格。"
    "" "She shoves the drawer shut with both hands, and her voice drops half a step."

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:138
translate english date6_b42d4ba8:

    # 知微 "……我说过，我不擅长解释。你只要知道结果：东西在第二格，随时能拿到。原因不重要。"
    知微 "...I've told you: explaining is not my strength. Just keep the result. They are in the second drawer, whenever you need one. The reason doesn't matter."

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:139
translate english date6_56e00cef:

    # 知微 "还有，今晚你来过这里这件事，也不重要。别写进作文里。"
    知微 "And the fact that you were here tonight — that doesn't matter either. Don't put it in an essay."

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:140
translate english date6_141c523b:

    # 我 "我不写。我写的话会写很长。"
    我 "I don't write. If I did, I'd write it very long."

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:142
translate english date6_d1499fb4:

    # 知微 "（手在身前乱摆）那更不许！"
    知微 "(She waves both hands in front of her) Then absolutely not!"

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:149
translate english date6_fd9a4457:

    # "她愣了半秒，低头把讲义翻回第三页，翻错了两次。"
    "" "She freezes for half a second, looks down to turn the handout back to page three, and misses the page twice."

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:151
translate english date6_d2f88c3e:

    # 知微 "（手掩着嘴笑了一下，马上收住）……第三页。看这里。这一步不是难点，难点是你肯不肯慢下来。"
    知微 "(She covers her mouth and laughs, then stops it at once.) ...Page three. Look here. This step is not the hard part. The hard part is whether you're willing to slow down."

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:152
translate english date6_6a735674:

    # 知微 "慢下来的人，成绩都不会太差。这句话也不重要，别记。"
    知微 "People who slow down never score badly. That sentence doesn't matter either. Don't remember it."

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:156
translate english date6_cbf0b5a9:

    # 知微 "……一句。只有一句。"
    知微 "...One sentence. Only one."

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:157
translate english date6_62207f00:

    # 知微 "下学期这里会空一半。我批的那个助教岗位，不是给你留的，是——学校要求必须有两个人签字。"
    知微 "Half of this room will be empty next term. The teaching assistant post I approved is not held for you — the school requires two signatures."

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:158
translate english date6_73355e25:

    # "她把牛奶盒捏扁，整整齐齐叠成一个小方块，放进包里。"
    "" "She flattens the carton, folds it into a neat little square, and puts it in her bag."

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:165
translate english date6_ab0950ee:

    # "你借整理讲义的名义，把这一幕拍了下来。快门声很轻，她假装没听见。"
    "" "On the excuse of tidying the handouts, you take the picture. The shutter is very quiet. She pretends not to hear it."

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:170
translate english date6_d127c07e:

    # sysvoice "获得回忆影像：[_m15]"
    sysvoice "Memory image acquired: [_m15]"

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:173
translate english date6_3d409317:

    # "锁门时她走在你后面半步。走廊的灯一盏一盏亮起来，是感应的，她每走一步就得停一下等灯。"
    "" "Locking up, she walks half a step behind you. The corridor lights come on one by one — motion sensors — so every step she takes ends in a small pause while she waits for the light."

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:175
translate english date6_885c8d64:

    # 知微 "（忽然，很轻）今天这家店……牛奶卖完了也没关系。"
    知微 "(Suddenly, very lightly) Today, even if this shop had sold out of milk ... it wouldn't have mattered."

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:176
translate english date6_2b0f03f9:

    # 我 "什么？"
    我 "What?"

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:178
translate english date6_68d0770e:

    # 知微 "没什么。走了。十分钟车程，我骑车跟在你后面——顺路回社团拿东西。"
    知微 "Nothing. Let's go. Ten minutes by bike — I'll ride behind you. It's on my way to the club room to fetch things."

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:179
translate english date6_8f9116d3:

    # "这句话你听过一次了。这次你没问她「社团不是反方向吗」。"
    "" "You have heard that line once before. This time you don't ask her: isn't the club room the other way?"

# game/scenes/devotion.rpy:180
translate english date6_854b557f:

    # "你只是把车速放慢了一点，让她不必假装在追你。"
    "" "You simply slow down a little, so she doesn't have to pretend she is chasing you."

translate english strings:

    old "那一格「周末：我」，你怎么签"
    new "That square reading 'Weekend: me' — how do you sign it"

    old "「闹钟也归你。叫醒我的第一件事，先听你说话。」"
    new "'The alarm is yours too. First thing after you wake me, I want to hear you talk.'"

    old "「留一格给我自己。不是不要你，是我得学会。」"
    new "'Leave one square for me. Not without you — I have to learn how.'"

    old "她把「原因不重要」说得很用力"
    new "She says 'the reason doesn't matter' a little too hard"

    old "「那我也说一句不重要的：我在等你讲完第三页。」"
    new "'Then I'll say one unimportant thing too: I'm waiting for you to finish page three.'"

    old "「重要的事，你可以说一句。」"
    new "'You're allowed one sentence that matters.'"

